---
// Four miniature failure-case cards, used on /mistakes/.
interface Props {
  class?: string;
}
const { class: className = "" } = Astro.props;
---
<div class={`mistake-grid ${className}`}>
  <figure class="mistake-grid__item">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 140 88" role="img" aria-labelledby="m1t">
      <title id="m1t">塗り足し不足で文字が切れている例</title>
      <rect x="4" y="4" width="132" height="80" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.4" />
      <text x="70" y="50" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-family="var(--font-display)" fill="var(--ink)">design studio</text>
      <line x1="0" y1="4" x2="140" y2="4" stroke="var(--vermilion)" stroke-width="3" />
      <text x="70" y="14" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="var(--vermilion)" font-family="var(--font-mono)">ここで切れる</text>
    </svg>
    <figcaption>塗り足しゼロで端の文字が断裁で切れる</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <figure class="mistake-grid__item">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 140 88" role="img" aria-labelledby="m2t">
      <title id="m2t">低解像度でロゴがぼやけている例</title>
      <rect x="4" y="4" width="132" height="80" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.4" />
      <g opacity="0.55" filter="url(#px)">
        <rect x="46" y="30" width="48" height="28" fill="var(--ink)" />
      </g>
      <filter id="px"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="1.6" /></filter>
      <text x="70" y="76" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="var(--vermilion)" font-family="var(--font-mono)">72dpiロゴを拡大</text>
    </svg>
    <figcaption>低解像度データを引き伸ばし、ロゴがぼやける</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <figure class="mistake-grid__item">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 140 88" role="img" aria-labelledby="m3t">
      <title id="m3t">白フチが均一でない例</title>
      <rect x="4" y="4" width="132" height="80" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.4" />
      <rect x="14" y="12" width="112" height="64" fill="var(--copper)" fill-opacity="0.35" />
      <rect x="14" y="12" width="112" height="64" fill="none" stroke="var(--vermilion)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 2" />
      <text x="70" y="80" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" fill="var(--vermilion)" font-family="var(--font-mono)">左右で白フチの幅が違う</text>
    </svg>
    <figcaption>断裁ズレを想定せず白フチの幅が不均一</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <figure class="mistake-grid__item">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 140 88" role="img" aria-labelledby="m4t">
      <title id="m4t">情報が多すぎて可読性が低い例</title>
      <rect x="4" y="4" width="132" height="80" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.4" />
      {Array.from({ length: 7 }).map((_, i) => (
        <line x1="14" y1={14 + i * 9} x2="126" y2={14 + i * 9} stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="2.4" opacity="0.75" />
      ))}
    </svg>
    <figcaption>情報を詰め込みすぎて余白がなく読みづらい</figcaption>
  </figure>
</div>

<style>
  .mistake-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line-strong);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  .mistake-grid__item {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper-deep);
    padding: 1rem;
  }
  .mistake-grid__item svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .mistake-grid__item figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .mistake-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
